/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/486835",
            "title": "shadow: 4.19.2 -> 4.19.3",
